間違ってなんかないのに
Even though you haven't done anything wrong,

317
00:31:05,958 --> 00:31:08,248
誰かが「違う」って言うんなら
if someone tells you that you're wrong—

318
00:31:08,248 --> 00:31:10,418
君を否定してしまうすべてを
everything that tries to deny who you are,

319
00:31:10,418 --> 00:31:12,798
僕は肯定なんかしないから
I will never validate or accept it.

320
00:31:12,798 --> 00:31:15,158
抱き締めついででもいいからさ
Even if it's just as an excuse to hold you close,

321
00:31:15,158 --> 00:31:17,428
不安も僕に流してよ
let all your anxieties flow into me.

322
00:31:17,428 --> 00:31:19,508
恥ずかしいって言うけれどさ
You might say it's embarrassing, but hey,

323
00:31:19,508 --> 00:31:21,888
それは僕も一緒なんだよ
I feel the exact same way too.

324
00:31:21,888 --> 00:31:24,088
似合ってないとか笑うなよ
Don't laugh and say it doesn't suit me—

325
00:31:24,088 --> 00:31:26,548
君に会えたことへの答えだよ
this is my answer to having met you.

326
00:31:26,548 --> 00:31:28,948
